West Georgia native blues artist, Jontavious Willis, is performing at Krannert Center on Friday January 24. If you don't have tickets, you can buy them here https://krannertcenter.com/events/jontavious-willis-band#.

If the performance schedule doesn't work with your schedule, you can come to the Blues After-Party at Bruce D. Nesbitt African American Cultural Center (BNAACC) on 9:30pm-11:30pm. This is a free event and you may even meet the Grammy-nominated artist himself.

Stacey Robinson, aka BLACKSTAR, and Chris Kinson, aka CK, are representing for Darker Than Blue and spinning fun bluesy and boozy tunes. It's going to be a fun time and opportunity to talk and meet other blues enthusiasts. Aaaaaaaannnnnndddddddd if there's room, then do a jig.
